     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear every one</div><div>This is a novice of Lavvan program</div><div>I have a question. I would like to draw a path diagram after Lavaan operating.</div><div>I made a following project. I&#39;m using<font><font><font><font><font color=\"#ffffff\"> <span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> <font color=\"#000000\">lavaan 0.5-18 </font></span></font><font color=\"#444444\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">lavaan which is BETA software. There is a error message.</span></font></font></font></font></font></div><div><font><font><font><font color=\"#444444\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Please give me tips.</span></font></font></font></font></div><div><font><font><font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"></span></font></font></font></font> </div><div><font><font><font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">                      -syntax-</span></font></font></font></font></div><div><font><font><font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">data1=read.csv(&quot;F:/KOSSDA/data/data1.csv&quot;)<br>model &lt;- &#39;price =~ x1 + x2 + x3 + x4<br>service =~ x5 + x6 + x7 + x8<br>Atmo =~ x9 + x10 + x11 + x12<br>CS =~ y1 + y2 + y3 + y4<br>CL =~ y5 + y6 + y7 + y8&#39;<br>fit &lt;- sem(model, data =data1)<br>summary(fit, standardized = TRUE)<br>lavaan.diagram(fit)</span></font></font></font></font></div><div><br></div><div>Best regards.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
