style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>best regards</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Niels</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div></div>"
